&lt;p&gt;Global Dimensions is currently seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Data Scientist&lt;/strong&gt; for a position in &lt;strong&gt;Stuttgart, Germany&lt;/strong&gt;, to support mission-critical data analysis and intelligence requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
