&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;16195&quot; data-end=&quot;16436&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-start=&quot;16195&quot; data-end=&quot;16436&quot;&gt;Do you thrive in a fast-paced environment, where you gain a tremendous amount of responsibility? Do you want to be part of an exceptional entrepreneurial team with ambitious, motivated people? And are you curious or passionate about sales?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1e1ijrh&quot; data-start=&quot;16438&quot; data-end=&quot;16450&quot;&gt;About us&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;16452&quot; data-end=&quot;16689&quot;&gt;Retail Insights is Northern Europe’s leading retail forum. We are strengthening the retail ecosystem by building a platform for insights, inspiration, and networking, connecting more than 3,000 leaders yearly from more than 15 countries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;16691&quot; data-end=&quot;16949&quot;&gt;Retail Insights is part of United Media which focuses on building large scale industry media and conferences products in sectors such as insurance, HR, private equity, retail, etc. As of today, we have organically launched 8 media companies and acquired one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;199rbhh&quot; data-start=&quot;16951&quot; data-end=&quot;16972&quot;&gt;What we offer you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;16974&quot; data-end=&quot;17111&quot;&gt;You will play a key role in helping us build some of the world&#39;s leading business conferences by bringing the right people into the room.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;17113&quot; data-end=&quot;17276&quot;&gt;We will give you the training, tools and responsibility to succeed while continuously challenging you to develop your commercial skills and accelerate your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;17278&quot; data-end=&quot;17387&quot;&gt;You’ll be based out of our HQ in London, where you will work alongside an ambitious and entrepreneurial team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;17389&quot; data-end=&quot;18133&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ybage9&quot; data-start=&quot;17389&quot; data-end=&quot;17534&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;17391&quot; data-end=&quot;17422&quot;&gt;Uncapped earning potential:&lt;/strong&gt; A competitive base salary and attractive commission structure where your results directly impact your earnings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;19891l5&quot; data-start=&quot;17535&quot; data-end=&quot;17681&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;17537&quot; data-end=&quot;17559&quot;&gt;Rapid development:&lt;/strong&gt; An opportunity to build exceptional sales skills in a high-performance environment with continuous coaching and feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1h9ytha&quot; data-start=&quot;17682&quot; data-end=&quot;17815&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;17684&quot; data-end=&quot;17711&quot;&gt;International exposure:&lt;/strong&gt; Speak every day with senior executives, investors and business leaders from companies around the world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2sktfi&quot; data-start=&quot;17816&quot; data-end=&quot;17947&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;17818&quot; data-end=&quot;17843&quot;&gt;International travel:&lt;/strong&gt; The opportunity to attend our conferences and see first-hand the events and communities you help build.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;fhk27a&quot; data-start=&quot;17948&quot; data-end=&quot;18133&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;17950&quot; data-end=&quot;17981&quot;&gt;Unlimited growth potential:&lt;/strong&gt; We strongly believe in promoting internally and have a track record of giving exceptional performers significant responsibility early in their careers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;11e7v6l&quot; data-start=&quot;18135&quot; data-end=&quot;18160&quot;&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;18162&quot; data-end=&quot;18302&quot;&gt;Your mission will be to drive revenue by selling delegate passes to senior professionals attending United Media&#39;s international conferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;18304&quot; data-end=&quot;18370&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities will vary; however, some of them will be to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;18372&quot; data-end=&quot;19354&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;tmy6xa&quot; data-start=&quot;18372&quot; data-end=&quot;18528&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;18374&quot; data-end=&quot;18405&quot;&gt;Drive new business revenue:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively reach out to prospective delegates and convert them into paying attendees across our portfolio of conferences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i7y3pm&quot; data-start=&quot;18529&quot; data-end=&quot;18662&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;18531&quot; data-end=&quot;18558&quot;&gt;Own your sales targets:&lt;/strong&gt; Take responsibility for ambitious monthly revenue targets and consistently work towards exceeding them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1axmqgo&quot; data-start=&quot;18663&quot; data-end=&quot;18850&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;18665&quot; data-end=&quot;18698&quot;&gt;Execute high-volume outreach:&lt;/strong&gt; Work within a fast-paced outbound sales environment, making 60+ calls per day and creating approximately 10 qualified sales opportunities or proposals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1esm6yd&quot; data-start=&quot;18851&quot; data-end=&quot;19004&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;18853&quot; data-end=&quot;18875&quot;&gt;Own your pipeline:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage prospects from first conversation through follow-up, proposal and close, ensuring opportunities continue to move forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1duzk3b&quot; data-start=&quot;19005&quot; data-end=&quot;19183&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;19007&quot; data-end=&quot;19028&quot;&gt;Become an expert:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop a strong understanding of our conferences, audiences and industries so you can confidently communicate why the right people should be in the room.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1m5dqzv&quot; data-start=&quot;19184&quot; data-end=&quot;19354&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;19186&quot; data-end=&quot;19215&quot;&gt;Collaborate across teams:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with our marketing, content and conference teams to continuously improve our campaigns and the experience we offer delegates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;fuv784&quot; data-start=&quot;19356&quot; data-end=&quot;19383&quot;&gt;What we expect from you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;19385&quot; data-end=&quot;19607&quot;&gt;You have a strong work ethic, a high sense of urgency and a genuine desire to succeed. You enjoy competing against ambitious targets, take ownership of your results and are motivated by seeing your own performance improve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;19609&quot; data-end=&quot;19748&quot;&gt;Most importantly, you &lt;strong data-start=&quot;19631&quot; data-end=&quot;19647&quot;&gt;want to sell&lt;/strong&gt;. You enjoy the chase, the conversation and the feeling of turning an opportunity into a closed deal.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;19750&quot; data-end=&quot;20864&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;s4d4zn&quot; data-start=&quot;19750&quot; data-end=&quot;19854&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;19752&quot; data-end=&quot;19773&quot;&gt;Drive &amp;amp; ambition:&lt;/strong&gt; You are highly motivated, competitive and want to be exceptional at what you do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;18ey7j5&quot; data-start=&quot;19855&quot; data-end=&quot;19998&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;19857&quot; data-end=&quot;19880&quot;&gt;Commercial mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; You are excited by targets, revenue and the opportunity to directly influence your earnings through your performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1f6cxo4&quot; data-start=&quot;19999&quot; data-end=&quot;20134&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;20001&quot; data-end=&quot;20016&quot;&gt;Resilience:&lt;/strong&gt; You are comfortable with a high level of outbound activity and have the persistence to keep going when you hear &quot;no&quot;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1asdq2a&quot; data-start=&quot;20135&quot; data-end=&quot;20281&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;20137&quot; data-end=&quot;20155&quot;&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; You are confident speaking with new people and can communicate professionally and persuasively over the phone and in writing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;8d1gzz&quot; data-start=&quot;20282&quot; data-end=&quot;20410&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;20284&quot; data-end=&quot;20310&quot;&gt;Relationship building:&lt;/strong&gt; You are genuinely curious about people and able to build rapport quickly with senior professionals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;xxtiog&quot; data-start=&quot;20411&quot; data-end=&quot;20539&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;20413&quot; data-end=&quot;20430&quot;&gt;Organisation:&lt;/strong&gt; You can prioritise effectively and stay on top of a large number of prospects, conversations and follow-ups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1798l9t&quot; data-start=&quot;20540&quot; data-end=&quot;20648&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;20542&quot; data-end=&quot;20561&quot;&gt;Growth mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; You actively seek feedback and continuously look for ways to improve your performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1l55rsf&quot; data-start=&quot;20649&quot; data-end=&quot;20864&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;20651&quot; data-end=&quot;20673&quot;&gt;Winning mentality:&lt;/strong&gt; Whether demonstrated through sales, academics, competitive sports, entrepreneurship or another environment, you have evidence of setting ambitious goals and pushing yourself to achieve them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;20866&quot; data-end=&quot;21135&quot;&gt;Previous sales experience is an advantage but &lt;strong data-start=&quot;20912&quot; data-end=&quot;20933&quot;&gt;not a requirement&lt;/strong&gt;. We are equally interested in exceptional graduates and early-career candidates who can demonstrate the drive, communication skills and competitive mindset needed to build a successful career in sales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;chxscz&quot; data-start=&quot;21137&quot; data-end=&quot;21162&quot;&gt;Start date: Flexible.&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;21164&quot; data-end=&quot;21306&quot;&gt;Monday–Friday we work from our office next to Sloane Square Station. Due to the collaborative nature of our work, we do not offer remote work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;21308&quot; data-end=&quot;21339&quot;&gt;You must have a UK work permit.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW142035299 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW142035299 BCX0&quot;&gt;Resolve to Save Lives (RTSL)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; is a global health organization that partners locally and globally to create and scale solutions to the world’s deadliest &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;health threats. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Millions of people die from preventable health threats. We collaborate to close the gap between proven, life-saving solutions and the people who need them. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Since 2017, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;we’ve&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; worked with governments and other partners in more than 60 countries to save millions of lives. We work toward a future where people live&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;longer, healthier lives, communities flourish, and economies thrive. This is an ambitious vision, and it inspires us and our partners to make progress every day.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Resolve to Save Lives&#39; Prevent Epidemics program works closely with Ministries of Health and national public health institutes in Africa to strengthen epidemic preparedness capacity, accelerate disease detection and response, and effectively use data to inform action. In addition to direct partnerships with governments, we also work with implementing partners, including the US CDC, the World Health Organization, the World Bank, and the Global Health Advocacy Incubator, to implement programs, prototype innovations, and ensure sustainability through increased national ownership, including domestic budget allocations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Position&amp;nbsp;Purpose:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Senior Technical Advisor, Data Use and Decision Science&lt;/strong&gt; focuses on bridging the gap between complex epidemiological and contextual data and strategic public health action. This role will primarily support the Democratic Republic of the Congo (DRC) Collaborative Surveillance (CS) portfolio, with a significant focus on accompaniment of DRC-based staff on 1) advancing data use for the current Ebola outbreak preparedness and rapid response, and 2) generating actionable analytics and information products to strengthen real-time decision-making, integrating disease surveillance with contextual data (e.g., climate, environmental, risk, and vulnerability factors) and supporting resilient data pipelines. Additionally, this role will contribute to the facilitation of two flagship programs - Epidemic Intelligence training curriculum, and a co-design workshop - to build national counterparts&#39; capacity for epidemic intelligence and systems thinking. The Senior Technical Advisor reports to the Principal Advisor, Data Use for Decision Science, Epidemic Intelligence. This full-time, remote position is for a fixed term of 2 years.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Core&amp;nbsp;Duties and&amp;nbsp;Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Senior Technical Advisor, Data Use and Decision Science collaborates with HQ-based staff and the DRC-based teams on data analytics, innovations and delivery. Responsibilities include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;Data Use for Decision Science&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:288}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;11&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1080,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Support the implementation of epidemic intelligence activities in DRC that inform decision-making, including development of innovative data use products (e.g., enhanced outbreak situation report, periodic epidemiological bulletins, executive dashboards) and implementation of automated production pipelines.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;11&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1080,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Collaborate closely with DRC country office and HQ team to map existing systems, data, and decision-making needs, in order to identify implementation priorities for Collaborative Surveillance and to support the development of a future surveillance architecture.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;11&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1080,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Provide hands-on technical accompaniment, capacity building, and knowledge transfer, including providing hands-on technical mentorship to DRC country office to ensure analytical and decision-support capabilities are sustained independently of external support.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;11&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1080,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;4&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Training DRC country-based staff and government counterparts on the use of digital tools, such as DHIS2, Emergency Management Systems (EMS), R and R markdown for data management, analytics, GIS, and data product generation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
