&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:280}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SharkNinja&amp;nbsp;is a global product design and technology company, with a diversified portfolio of 5-star rated lifestyle solutions that positively&amp;nbsp;impact&amp;nbsp;people’s lives in homes around the world. &lt;strong&gt;Powered by two trusted, global brands, Shark and Ninja&lt;/strong&gt;, the company has a proven&amp;nbsp;track record&amp;nbsp;of bringing disruptive innovation to market and developing one consumer product after another has allowed&amp;nbsp;SharkNinja&amp;nbsp;to enter multiple product categories, driving significant growth and market share gains. Headquartered in Needham, Massachusetts with more than&amp;nbsp;4,100&amp;nbsp;associates, the company’s products are sold at key retailers, online and offline, and through distributors around the world.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI at SharkNinja &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SharkNinja, we’re building an AI-native culture. We’re not waiting for the future; we’re creating it. Our people are expected to experiment boldly, adopt new tools, and continuously raise what’s possible to create meaningful impact for our consumers. If you believe the best way to do your job hasn’t been invented yet, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Senior Manager, Digital Distribution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;London (Battersea Power Station) / Hybrid&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;About the role &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Senior Manager, Digital Distribution&amp;nbsp;is responsible for&amp;nbsp;helping shape and execute&amp;nbsp;SharkNinja&#39;s&amp;nbsp;digital distribution strategy across the DTC and ecommerce channel. This role combines commercial delivery with operational excellence, managing how&amp;nbsp;SharkNinja&#39;s&amp;nbsp;products and experiences reach consumers through owned and partner digital channels. The ideal candidate is a strong operator who can drive a scaling digital distribution capability within a complex, fast-growing global organisation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Senior Manager, Digital Distribution owns how the model works — the launch standard, the commercial framework, the&amp;nbsp;governance&amp;nbsp;and the partner capability that&amp;nbsp;determine&amp;nbsp;whether each market succeeds.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Several markets are already live. The immediate priority is bringing the existing estate to a single standard, then making every&amp;nbsp;subsequent&amp;nbsp;launch faster and cheaper than the last. This is a hands-on operating role. It suits someone who can hold a standard with external partners who already have their own ways of working, and who is as comfortable in a weekly trading review as in a launch gate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you will do:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
