&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Account Manager/Senior Account Manager – Medical Communications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;London/Manchester/Hybrid/Remote(UK)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At &lt;strong&gt;Inizio Medical&lt;/strong&gt;, the combined expertise of &lt;strong&gt;ApotheCom, Nucleus Global, and Ashfield Medcomms&lt;/strong&gt;, supported by the specialist skills of &lt;strong&gt;MEDiSTRAVA&lt;/strong&gt;, brings together world-leading medical communications excellence. We create compelling scientific content, connect expert communities, and deliver outcomes that truly matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Due to continued growth, we&#39;re looking for an Account Manager/Senior Account Manager&amp;nbsp;to join the &lt;strong&gt;ApotheCom&lt;/strong&gt; team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a dynamic and varied role offering the chance to work across a diverse range of projects within a supportive, established, and collaborative team. You&#39;ll grow your expertise and grow your career in an environment that values innovation, quality, and teamwork.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be responsible for leading the delivery of complex scientific communications and Medical Affairs programmes, ensuring projects are executed on time, within budget, and to the highest quality standards. You&#39;ll be a trusted partner to clients, managing risks, financial performance, and cross-functional teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage publications and medical affairs projects from initiation through to completion, including &lt;strong&gt;abstracts, posters, manuscripts, congress deliverables, advisory boards, slide decks, medical education materials, training programmes, scientific platforms&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead multiple concurrent projects and workstreams across client programmes, ensuring timely delivery and effective resource management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain project plans, timelines, and status trackers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate multidisciplinary internal teams and external stakeholders to ensure seamless project execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own project financial management, including budget development, forecasting, invoicing, revenue recognition, and profitability tracking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing Statements of Work (SOWs), monitoring scope, identifying change requests and out-of-scope activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain client relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience within a &lt;strong&gt;Medical Communications agency&lt;/strong&gt; in a project/account or programme management role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing &lt;strong&gt;scientific publications&lt;/strong&gt; (including abstracts, posters, and manuscripts) and a broad range of &lt;strong&gt;Medical Affairs deliverables&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to manage multiple complex projects simultaneously while balancing quality, timelines, budgets, and client expectations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project financial management experience, including budgeting, forecasting, invoicing, and financial reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organisational, planning, and communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building client relationships and leading project communications with both internal and external stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Inizio Medical, we believe our people are our strength. You&#39;ll enjoy:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/strong&gt;, including &lt;strong&gt;private medical insurance&lt;/strong&gt; and a &lt;strong&gt;company pension&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible, hybrid working&lt;/strong&gt; options to support work-life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;friendly and inclusive culture&lt;/strong&gt; with regular &lt;strong&gt;Friday socials&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;wellbeing initiatives&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;Town Hall events&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional &lt;strong&gt;career development opportunities&lt;/strong&gt; and access to world-class learning resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud to promote a culture of &lt;strong&gt;diversity, inclusion, and belonging&lt;/strong&gt;. We believe our differences make us stronger — and that diversity drives innovation, creativity, and success.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Don&#39;t meet every job requirement? That&#39;s okay! Our company is dedicated to building a diverse, inclusive, and authentic workplace. If you&#39;re excited about this role, but your experience doesn&#39;t perfectly fit every qualification, we encourage you to apply anyway. You may be just the right person for this role or others.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
